                    "paragraphs": [
                        "Before you begin, register an <strong>OIDC client</strong> in your Daon TrustX tenant and obtain a <strong>Client ID & secret</strong>. Note the Daon <strong>authorization</strong> and <strong>token</strong> endpoint URLs, and the <strong>process definitions</strong> to use for login (verified users) and enrolment (first-time verification)."
